  "ud8.2:2.1": "viditvā tāyaṃ velāyaṃ imaṃ udānaṃ udānesi: ",
  "ud8.2:3.1": "duddasaṃ anattaṃ nāma, ",
  "ud8.2:3.2": "na hi saccaṃ sudassanaṃ, ",
  "ud8.2:3.3": "paṭividdhā taṇhā jānato, ",
  "ud8.2:3.4": "passato n' atthi kiñcanan ti. ||2|| VIII.3 = VIII.1 ",
  "ud8.2:3.5": "and 2. etam atthaṃ "
